  "item": [
    {
      "id": "7d6b03d8-37dd-4381-adc4-68a9d21df7fa",
      "name": "User",
      "description": {
        "content": "Safe approval endpoints for enabling trading on your proxy wallet.\n\n## Safe approval signature — raw secp256k1\n\n- Sign the `transactionHash` from prepare response **directly** (raw secp256k1)\n- **No EIP-191 prefix** / no `personal_sign`\n- Format: `0x<r><s><v>` (132 hex chars) with low-s normalization\n- `v` normalized to 27 or 28\n\n**MANDATORY: After completing Safe approval (prepare, sign, execute), you MUST call `POST /api/v1/auth/login-with-signature` again to get a fresh JWT with `is_enabled_trading=true`. Without this re-login, order placement/cancellation will fail with \"trading not enabled\". A token refresh alone is NOT sufficient.**\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "a2604f6b-12a4-4bc5-8a72-fd81022de1bf",
          "name": "Prepare Safe approval transaction",
          "request": {
            "name": "Prepare Safe approval transaction",
            "description": {
              "content": "Prepare a Safe wallet approval transaction. Send `safe_wallet_address` = your `proxy_wallet_addr` from login; sign the returned `transactionHash` with raw secp256k1 (no EIP-191); then call execute with signature and data.\n\nSee **Trading Enablement** section for full flow and mandatory re-login after execute.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "user",
                "safe-approval",
                "prepare"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
